  "item_short_desc": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Get ready for duty with Rothco&rsquo;s Long Sleeve Uniform Shirt. The long sleeve shirt features epaulets with reinforced \"X\" stitching and a sling badge tape, allowing you to display your rank and badge securely and with ease. Adjustable cuffs and a placket vent with a center button at the wrist enable you to customize the sleeves to your comfort, ensuring a perfect fit.&nbsp;The uniform shirt includes hook and loop pleated patch pockets with scalloped flaps, providing secure storage for essential items while maintaining a professional look.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "1513",
  "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Get ready for duty with Rothco&rsquo;s Long Sleeve Uniform Shirt. The long sleeve shirt features epaulets with reinforced \"X\" stitching and a sling badge tape, allowing you to display your rank and badge securely and with ease. Adjustable cuffs and a placket vent with a center button at the wrist enable you to customize the sleeves to your comfort, ensuring a perfect fit. The uniform shirt includes hook and loop pleated patch pockets with scalloped flaps, providing secure storage for essential items while maintaining a professional look. The collared shirt features permanent collar stays to meet uniform expectations and sewn-in creases to ensure a sharp, well-put-together appearance. Constructed from a breathable yet durable poly-cotton blend, this shirt offers comfort and longevity, making it a reliable choice for everyday wear in demanding environments.</p>",
